# Oracle O3 CPAN distributions, in install order (dependencies first).
# Paths are relative to CPAN authors/id/.  Versions are those bundled in the
# TeX Live 2026 biber 2.22 PAR binary ("PAR") wherever the PAR bundles the
# distribution; distributions the PAR does not bundle (build/test-only tools,
# or modules the packer did not pick up) are pinned to the CPAN-latest version
# as of 2026-10-02 ("not-in-PAR").  Generated by the discovery procedure in
# tools/oracle/README.md, then frozen.
#
